## Risks and watch-outs

- **Glamour rendering of italic affordance** — `*Not generated yet…*` rendered through the brand styles is new content. If the Glamour theme renders `*…*` strangely (e.g., as bold instead of italic), tweak `entireBrandMarkdownStyles` only as a last resort; prefer changing the affordance to a markdown blockquote (`> Not generated yet…`) which is well-tested.
